Z||000000||aleroboy||12-14-2001||01:08 AM||||I was wondering if anyone has stats on this car?<BR>how rare are they? whyat are my chances on getting one? and how much can I expect to pay?||||reg||1
Z||000001||RossT||12-14-2001||02:27 AM||||about 1252 88's came with t-tops when delivered to the dealership.  The same t-top kit could be installed installed in non t-top cars.  Somewhere around 2,000 kits were made and installed in 84-88's<P>very low mileage 88gts (less than 2-3,000 mies) with t-tops can be found for around $14,000 to over $20,000<BR>(I have one, you want it?)<P>Higher mileage t-top car can be found for much less, but make sure that the tops,seals and endcaps are all in good conditions because parts are very hard to come by. <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroparts.com</A>  has some parts<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||aleroboy||12-14-2001||12:06 PM||||sweet! thanks for the info.<BR>if I had the cash right now I'd buy your t-top in a heart beat!<BR>maybe if it's still around when I got the cash.||||reg||1
